    "description": "I've worked in multiple positions as a volunteer with APO. I've been:\n- Chapter representative (visit regularly with a specific Chapter and act as a liaison between them and the National Fraternity)\n- Chapter Advisor (work directly with the Chapter to help them with any issues they have)\n- Section Chair (oversee a staff with responsibility for a given area - I was responsible for the eastern half of New York State)\n- Regional Membership Coordinator (work with Chapters across the Region to help with recruiting and retention - I am responsible for New York, Eastern Pennsylvania, and Delaware)\n- APO LEADS presenter (present leadership development courses across both my Region and the adjoining one)\n- Additional volunteer projects in many areas (Habitat For Humanity, Ronald McDonald House, trash cleanup, etc)",
